# Menu entry template for jpackage's deb and rpm (resource-dir override; the name is the launcher's).
# JDK 25/26's own template with two changes. " %u" on the Exec line: without it a double-clicked .bmk starts
# Studio without the file (2026-10-25); %u, not %f, so a clicked botmaker:// link arrives too, a file as a path or
# a file: URI. The MimeType line is written out rather than jpackage's, to add x-scheme-handler/botmaker; the .bmk
# type is the one every installer associates. Words in capitals are jpackage's placeholders; never write one in a
# comment.
[Desktop Entry]
Name=APPLICATION_NAME
Comment=APPLICATION_DESCRIPTION
Exec=APPLICATION_LAUNCHER %u
STARTUP_DIRECTORY
Icon=APPLICATION_ICON
Terminal=false
Type=Application
Categories=DEPLOY_BUNDLE_CATEGORY
MimeType=application/x-botmaker-bot;x-scheme-handler/botmaker;
